description "Visquis

A cowardly crimeboss who'd prefer to set up a killzone with his droids

^2Weaponry:
- Unskilled Melee
-- 100% slower RoF
-- Punch/block only
- Exchange Blaster Pistol (DC Carb 1)
-- 200% slower RoF
-- 400% slower reload
-- Mag Reload
- Stun Baton (Cyan)
-- 40 Damage
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- Pulses/Stuns/Cripples On Hit
- Tripmines (10)
-- Tracks
- Detpacks (10)
-- Ignites/Cripples
- Thermal Detonator (1)

^6Inventory:
- Medpac
- Adv Medpac
- Exchange Remote Droid (Beacon) ^3[CS2]
- Personal Energy Shield 
- Exchange Sentry Turret ^3[CS4]
- Exchange Defensive Remote ^3[CS1]
- Exchange Seeker Remote ^3[CS3]
- Force Field

^8Attributes:
- G0T0, The Exchange Leader (Bodyguard)
- Remote Viewer
- Stat Viewer
- Healing (3)
- Rally
- Force Sense Immunity
- Anti Mind Trick (1)
- Health/Armor Dispenser (1) ^3[USE In Melee]
- No Gunbash/Pickups
- 100% slower skill cooldown
- 40% less knockback given
- 25% more knockback taken"